2026-07-27T08:36:37.5527336Z i /tmp/RtmpMY3w4G/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:36:37.5527582Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:36:37.5527862Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:36:37.5528304Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:36:37.5528895Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:36:37.5529440Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:36:37.5529843Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
